<title>MALAYSIA: United Engineers 9-mth net up 80 pct.</title>
<headline>United Engineers 9-mth net up 80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30,1996</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	 328.64	  vs	  182.46</p>
<p>    Shr	(cents)  48.4	   vs	   33.5</p>
<p>    Turnover	 2,347.87	  vs	1,193.58</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit   457.17	  vs	  270.28</p>
<p>    Minorities  less  80.15	  vs  less   43.65</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries    5.86	  vs	    4.46</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's full name is United Engineers (Malaysia) Bhd. It is involved in construction of large infrastructure projects.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
